# Bash

- Public names: verb first (`get` / `set` / `has` / `is`).
- `local -n` only for arrays; pass the original array name into callees.
- No one-line shortcut wrappers around existing functions.
- Prefer clarity over cleverness; match the surrounding script’s Bash baseline.
